WasmFS Node backend: fsync() hits WASMFS_UNREACHABLE

NodeFile::flush() was a TODO that trapped, so fsync() on a host file
killed the program. Flush the host fd.

Upstream: not filed yet
Draft: docs/upstream/emscripten-wasmfs-node-fsync.md

